## Implementation Summary

**What was implemented:**
- Added new function `filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[]` to `/Users/tijs/projects/local-model-bench/runner/runs/tmp8uz4zkl_/run/src/bookmarks.ts`
- The function returns only bookmarks that contain ALL specified tags (AND semantics)
- Handles empty `tags` array by returning all bookmarks unchanged

**Implementation code:**
```typescript
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  if (tags.length === 0) {
    return bookmarks;
  }
  
  return bookmarks.filter((bookmark) => 
    tags.every((tag) => bookmark.tags.includes(tag))
  );
}
```

